# --- Quote form delivery (recommended before launch) ---------------------------------
# URL of a form-handling service that emails submissions to a monitored business inbox,
# for example a Formspree endpoint: https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx
# Leave empty and the form opens a prefilled WhatsApp message instead (nothing is stored).
VITE_QUOTE_FORM_ENDPOINT=

# --- EVA assistant (optional) --------------------------------------------------------
# URL of YOUR server-side EVA endpoint (see server/eva-proxy). Never put an AI provider
# API key, model name or prompt in any VITE_ variable: they are published in the browser.
# Leave empty and the site shows a plain "Talk to us" contact widget instead of EVA.
VITE_EVA_API_URL=
